o.jpg"}], "slug": "dungeons-and-donuts", "summary": "Dungeons & Donuts is a co-op action RPG that combines bullet hell dodging with roguelite dungeon runs for up to four players online, and is also playable solo. Between runs, players sell loot in a village, tend a farm, develop the settlement for materials, and craft donuts that act as consumable power-ups shaping the next run. Dungeon runs feature randomized power-up drops and last roughly 10 to 18 minutes, with Delves providing special ores for gear enhancement. Developed by the two-person team at Sas & Sons Game Studio, the game launched in Steam Early Access in August 2026.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/dungeons-and-donuts", "videos": [{"id": 192155, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "alPRtpKS24U", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=alPRtpKS24U", "title": "Dungeons & Donuts Early Access Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/alPRtpKS24U/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}